	(text "+3V3A (op amp) = GPIO AFE_EN (P0.13, high drive, held high while scanning) through R27 100R, 1u + 100n.\nThe op amp draws under 1 mA; the pin also gates it for sleep.  100R / 1u (not 22R / 4.7u as on +3V3M): the pin\ncharges the capacitors at switch-on, this keeps the peak near 25 mA and the charge at 3.6 uC (same 1.4 kHz corner).\nReason for not feeding it from +3V3: docs/tc52w-build-log.md"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 314.96 279.40 0)
		(effects (font (size 2.5 2.5)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "1a6bf5b6-e53b-5013-8bc1-7bcaed87af95")
	)
